<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>COMBINATION CARRIERS - Protank Mersey - (built 19830 54,500 dwt plus sistership:</p>
<p>Protank Medway - (built 1984) 54,500 dwt sold enbloc to Italian buyers for $29 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Xing Chang - (built 1974) 54,609 dwt sold to Bangladeshi breakers for $162.5 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection,  survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
